{"seeds": [1]}
{"comment": "alice plays hangman alone and solves it. Seed 1 draws the word \"proof\". Malformed guesses, a word outside the list and repeated guesses are refused and cost nothing; letters and listed words that miss each cost one of six misses; letters that hit fill the pattern, and the whole word wins, with the word in the finishing push."}
