{"comment": "Two letters are neither one letter nor a whole word: an illegal_action."}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 3, "type": "game.act", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 0, "action": {"kind": "guess", "text": "ab"}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 3, "type": "error", "body": {"code": "illegal_action", "message": "a guess is one letter a-z or a 5-letter word, got \"ab\""}}}
{"comment": "A whole word must be in the word list."}
